  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: S4
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: What IS it that drives you?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Is it desperation?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Hope that things play out differently?
  - speaker: 2
    text: You did this to me!
  - speaker: 0
    text: No matter what you do, it always ends the same.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "You can\u2019t change the past."
  - speaker: 2
    text: Do you feel NOTHING?!
